54
00:06:58,669 --> 00:06:59,897
Any Chips ?

55
00:06:59,921 --> 00:07:04,450
Why , of course . I believe there 's a whole bag .

56
00:07:05,843 --> 00:07:07,745
I 'm almost sure of it .

57
00:07:08,513 --> 00:07:15,579
Angela , isn 't there anything special my little girl would care for , hmm ?

58
00:07:15,603 --> 00:07:17,581
We gotta go , mom . It 's getting late .

59
00:07:17,605 --> 00:07:21,210
Well of course you do , dear . We wouldn 't want them to leave without us ,

60
00:07:21,234 --> 00:07:22,676
now would we ?

61
00:07:23,444 --> 00:07:26,347
No . No , I 'm afraid that that wouldn 't do .

62
00:07:27,281 --> 00:07:32,102
Come , children . Let 's be on our way .

63
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:38,859
Now what ?

64
00:07:39,419 --> 00:07:44,281
I believe that I 've forgotten something . Now , what can it be ?

65
00:07:45,842 --> 00:07:49,488
Oh , I remember what it is . I knew I would forget .

66
00:07:49,512 --> 00:07:53,541
I just kept reminding myself . In fact , I tied a string around ...

67
00:07:54,642 --> 00:07:58,963
Around my finger , so I wouldn 't forget .

68
00:07:59,063 --> 00:08:00,374
See ?

69
00:08:00,398 --> 00:08:04,593
And I didn 't . You never can be too careful .

70
00:08:10,867 --> 00:08:12,601
Well , what is it already ?

71
00:08:15,163 --> 00:08:19,567
Oh , just a moment ! I 'll be right back !

72
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,945
Good old Mom 's at it again .

73
00:08:23,004 --> 00:08:27,025
Here they are ! All filled out and signed by yours truly .

74
00:08:27,049 --> 00:08:29,403
Wasn 't that nice of me , hmm ?

75
00:08:29,427 --> 00:08:32,364
- What are they ? - Why , they 're your physicals , of course .

76
00:08:32,388 --> 00:08:35,332
We can 't go to camp without our physicals , now can we ?

77
00:08:35,641 --> 00:08:38,794
Just be careful not to tell anyone how you got them .

78
00:08:39,312 --> 00:08:42,798
Oh , no , I 'm afraid that they wouldn 't approve of that at all .

79
00:08:43,733 --> 00:08:46,253
Even though they know that I am a doctor .

80
00:08:46,277 --> 00:08:48,596
No matter what they do , I 'll never tell .

81
00:08:48,654 --> 00:08:52,474
Oh , you 're such a dear .

82
00:08:54,118 --> 00:08:56,013
Well , run along now .

83
00:08:56,037 --> 00:08:59,766
- So long , Mom . - Goodbye , my angel .

84
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:04,862
I hope you have a good time . But of course you will .

85
00:09:05,171 --> 00:09:07,907
Take good care of my little girl , Richard !

86
00:09:08,174 --> 00:09:12,328
- Goodbye , Mom . - Goodbye , dear .

87
00:10:11,654 --> 00:10:17,309
Look at all that young , fresh chicken . Where I come from we call them baldies .

88
00:10:18,035 --> 00:10:20,020
Makes your mouth water , don 't it ?

89
00:10:20,162 --> 00:10:24,851
Artie . They 're too young to even understand what 's on your mind .

90
00:10:24,875 --> 00:10:27,987
Ben , good buddy , there ain 't any such thing as being too young .

91
00:10:28,671 --> 00:10:30,322
You 're just too old .

92
00:10:49,442 --> 00:10:51,670
Ahh ! Ricky , how you doin ' ?

93
00:10:51,694 --> 00:10:53,839
- Paul , great to see you . - You winning ?

94
00:10:53,863 --> 00:10:56,015
Ah , you know . Same old shit .

95
00:10:56,073 --> 00:10:58,726
- Hey , this is my cousin Angela . - How you doin ' ?

96
00:11:00,828 --> 00:11:04,141
She 's kind of shy , I guess . You know , first time away from home and all .

97
00:11:04,165 --> 00:11:05,801
Listen , I got to take her down to the bunks .

98
00:11:05,825 --> 00:11:07,019
I 'll catch you down the hill , ok ?

99
00:11:07,043 --> 00:11:08,193
You got it .

100
00:11:11,964 --> 00:11:13,157
Hey , Rick .

101
00:11:13,549 --> 00:11:15,617
Wait 'll you get a load of Judy !

102
00:11:15,676 --> 00:11:17,362
Man , oh , man .

103
00:11:17,386 --> 00:11:18,905
Oh , yeah ?

104
00:11:18,929 --> 00:11:20,247
You 'll see .

105
00:11:21,557 --> 00:11:24,411
Me and Judy were steadies last summer .

106
00:11:24,435 --> 00:11:26,515
Hey , you 'll probably be in the same cabin .

107
00:11:37,281 --> 00:11:38,884
These are all the girls ' cabins .

108
00:11:38,908 --> 00:11:42,471
Over there is the rec hall . Next to that is Ronnie 's shack .

109
00:11:42,495 --> 00:11:45,939
Behind that 's the archery range . There she is !

110
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:49,985
Judy ! Yo , Judy ! How you doin ' ?

111
00:11:50,252 --> 00:11:51,438
Alright .

112
00:11:51,462 --> 00:11:53,655
Who 's the wimp ?

113
00:11:53,839 --> 00:11:55,442
Oh , that 's Ricky .

114
00:11:55,466 --> 00:11:57,361
Wasn 't he the kid you were babysitting last year ?

115
00:11:57,385 --> 00:11:59,870
Guess I 'm not good enough for her anymore .

116
00:12:05,685 --> 00:12:07,204
Well , here you go , Angela .

117
00:12:07,228 --> 00:12:09,289
If you need anything , I 'll be in bunk 19 , below .

118
00:12:09,313 --> 00:12:10,672
Second from the bottom .

119
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:20,550
- Who were those guys ? - Just some boys I met today .

120
00:12:20,574 --> 00:12:22,601
Weren 't they a little old for you ?

121
00:12:23,035 --> 00:12:24,971
Don 't you know girls mature before boys ?

122
00:12:24,995 --> 00:12:26,723
That 's bullshit and you know it .

123
00:12:26,747 --> 00:12:29,691
Ricky , I don 't have time for your nonsense right now .

124
00:12:31,252 --> 00:12:34,571
Well , excuse me . Bitch .

125
00:12:44,974 --> 00:12:48,829
Alright , ladies . Let 's hurry it up and unpack

126
00:12:48,853 --> 00:12:50,170
so we can get these trunks the hell out of here .

127
00:12:50,354 --> 00:12:53,792
By the way , for those of you who don 't know , the name is Meg .

128
00:12:53,816 --> 00:12:55,968
M-E-G .

129
00:12:57,111 --> 00:13:00,966
This here is Susie . You got any problems , this is the complaint department .

130
00:13:00,990 --> 00:13:02,891
Got it ? Ok ? Capische ?

131
00:13:13,043 --> 00:13:14,862
