132
00:13:24,680 --> 00:13:27,040
What , are you taking pictures ? Quit it !

133
00:13:27,725 --> 00:13:31,879
You must be Angela . Remember ? Ronnie spoke to us about her .

134
00:13:32,730 --> 00:13:35,174
Looks like we got a real winner here .

135
00:13:35,524 --> 00:13:37,885
You ain 't kidding .

136
00:13:49,663 --> 00:13:51,940
Quiet , please .

137
00:13:54,627 --> 00:13:57,321
Thanks for nothing .

138
00:13:58,506 --> 00:14:01,700
Quiet , please .

139
00:14:14,396 --> 00:14:17,049
See what I mean , Ronnie ? She hasn 't even touched it .

140
00:14:18,692 --> 00:14:21,463
Angela , Meg tells me you haven 't eaten much since you 've been here .

141
00:14:21,487 --> 00:14:22,339
Is that true ?

142
00:14:22,363 --> 00:14:25,974
You won 't get a peep out of this one . She hasn 't said a word in three days .

143
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:29,763
Tell you what . How about if you and me take a walk into the kitchen ?

144
00:14:29,787 --> 00:14:32,814
See if we can find something you like . That sound okay ?

145
00:14:34,375 --> 00:14:36,603
I 'm gonna take her inside to see Artie . She 'll be alright .

146
00:14:36,627 --> 00:14:38,904
Probably a little homesick , is all .

147
00:14:39,046 --> 00:14:40,155
Come on , Angela .

148
00:14:45,803 --> 00:14:48,997
He 's starting to spoil the little brat already .

149
00:14:54,603 --> 00:14:59,132
Hey Ben , is Artie around ? Artie , can I see you for a minute , please ?

150
00:15:00,985 --> 00:15:04,012
Hey , Artie . Be a little more discrete with the beer can , huh ?

151
00:15:04,154 --> 00:15:06,383
Sure , Ron . What 's up ?

152
00:15:06,407 --> 00:15:10,060
I want you to meet one of our new campers . Angela , this is Artie , our head chef .

153
00:15:11,537 --> 00:15:13,855
Well , hello there , Angela .

154
00:15:14,832 --> 00:15:16,483
Can you get that , Ben ? Please ?

155
00:15:17,668 --> 00:15:19,736
As you can see , she isn 't very talkative .

156
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:22,524
In fact , she isn 't much of a fan of your cooking , either .

157
00:15:22,548 --> 00:15:25,402
You think you could find something for her ? Some ice cream , or , you know ...

158
00:15:25,426 --> 00:15:26,987
Phone for you and Mel , Ron .

159
00:15:27,011 --> 00:15:28,989
Do me a favor . Get Mel , will you ?

160
00:15:29,013 --> 00:15:31,116
See what you can do , okay , Artie ? I 'll catch you later .

161
00:15:31,140 --> 00:15:33,583
No problem . I 'll find something she likes .

162
00:15:33,976 --> 00:15:36,753
I 'll bet we can find something interesting in the walk-in .

163
00:15:37,396 --> 00:15:39,923
You never know what you can find in there .

164
00:15:47,323 --> 00:15:48,557
Where 's my cousin ?

165
00:15:48,657 --> 00:15:50,176
Ronnie took her into the kitchen .

166
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:52,769
- She eat anything ? - What do you think ?

167
00:15:52,828 --> 00:15:56,600
What 's her problem , anyway ? She don 't eat , she don 't talk , she don 't do anything .

168
00:15:56,624 --> 00:15:59,318
Why don 't you leave her alone ? She 's just quiet .

169
00:16:01,629 --> 00:16:04,323
If she were any quieter , she 'd be dead .

170
00:16:10,220 --> 00:16:12,914
So Angela , see anything you like ?

171
00:16:14,767 --> 00:16:16,335
Maybe I can help you decide .

172
00:16:19,063 --> 00:16:21,965
You sure are a sweet-looking little cupcake , ain 't you ?

173
00:16:25,110 --> 00:16:29,222
Yeah . Think I got something you 're gonna like real good .

174
00:16:33,827 --> 00:16:35,227
Hey , what are you doing ? !

175
00:16:36,538 --> 00:16:37,641
Keep your mouth shut , you hear me ?

176
00:16:37,665 --> 00:16:39,893
You didn 't see nothin ' ! Got it ? Nothin ' !

177
00:16:39,917 --> 00:16:42,598
- Sure . Whatever you want . - Now get the hell out of here .

178
00:16:47,466 --> 00:16:49,993
Hey , What 's going on ?

179
00:16:51,095 --> 00:16:52,704
What was that all about ?

180
00:16:54,682 --> 00:16:56,500
Guess I scared him .

181
00:17:00,187 --> 00:17:01,880
I guess so .

182
00:17:09,488 --> 00:17:12,300
Want to check on the water ? About done over here .

183
00:17:12,324 --> 00:17:15,602
That damn water better be done . It 's been on a half hour . Shit !

184
00:17:16,495 --> 00:17:20,565
- Gimme that goddamn chair . - All yours , my good man .

185
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:26,840
It 's still got a couple minutes to go .

186
00:17:27,006 --> 00:17:29,484
Gonna grab some hay before dinner . You coming ?

187
00:17:29,508 --> 00:17:32,661
- Yeah , after I throw the corn in . - See you later .

188
00:18:18,974 --> 00:18:20,667
Boiling yet ?

189
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,462
Atta girl .

190
00:18:46,418 --> 00:18:48,313
Motherfucker , you could have killed me !

191
00:18:48,337 --> 00:18:50,530
Now get the hell over here and help me down .

192
00:18:52,341 --> 00:18:53,533
Come on , kid .

193
00:18:54,009 --> 00:18:57,287
Get me down and I 'll make you a nice ice cream sundae , okay ?

194
00:18:59,890 --> 00:19:02,125
Hey , what the ... What the hell you doin ' ? !

195
00:19:02,476 --> 00:19:03,995
You little shit !

196
00:19:04,019 --> 00:19:06,331
When I get down from here I 'm gonna rip your fucking head off !

197
00:19:06,355 --> 00:19:08,632
Ben ! Help ! Ben !

198
00:19:09,108 --> 00:19:12,128
Ben ! Get the hell in here ! Ben !

199
00:19:12,152 --> 00:19:15,423
Help ! Ben ! Ben !

200
00:19:15,447 --> 00:19:16,640
Ben !

201
00:20:14,631 --> 00:20:18,778
I 'm afraid I don 't carry a sedative strong enough to mask

202
00:20:18,802 --> 00:20:20,931
the kind of agony he 's in right now . Every

203
00:20:20,955 --> 00:20:22,740
nerve in his body must feel like it 's on fire .

204
00:20:22,764 --> 00:20:24,762
What 's the prognosis , Doc ?

205
00:20:25,158 --> 00:20:27,328
Well , he 's badly burned all over .

206
00:20:27,352 --> 00:20:28,663
Especially his face .

207
00:20:28,687 --> 00:20:30,255
How about his eyes ?

208
00:20:31,434 --> 00:20:32,669
Too early to tell .

209
00:20:32,694 --> 00:20:34,903
Jesus , the pain must be incredible .

210
00:20:35,033 --> 00:20:36,761
Poor guy must be going crazy .

211
00:20:37,279 --> 00:20:38,256
Yeah , if he 's lucky .

212
00:20:38,287 --> 00:20:40,316
Look , can we move this along , please ?

213
00:20:42,520 --> 00:20:44,519
No need to upset the campers , right ?

214
00:20:45,871 --> 00:20:47,606
Well , I guess I 'll be on my way .

215
00:20:49,416 --> 00:20:50,602
Now what ?

216
00:20:50,649 --> 00:20:53,920
Now we get this ambulance out of here as quickly as we can .

217
00:20:54,098 --> 00:20:55,648
Why ? It was only an accident .

218
00:20:55,801 --> 00:20:57,110
Because I don 't want the kids

219
00:20:57,134 --> 00:20:59,102
