220
00:20:59,134 --> 00:21:00,410
You understand ?

221
00:21:00,768 --> 00:21:01,567
What about them ?

222
00:21:02,554 --> 00:21:03,872
Don 't worry .

223
00:21:04,348 --> 00:21:05,832
I 'll take care of them .

224
00:21:11,313 --> 00:21:13,393
Real shame what happened to Artie in here .

225
00:21:13,815 --> 00:21:16,718
In the future , I hope the rest of you will be more careful .

226
00:21:18,489 --> 00:21:19,442
Ben ?

227
00:21:20,794 --> 00:21:23,575
I guess that makes you the head man here now , doesn 't it ?

228
00:21:24,201 --> 00:21:27,028
I wasn 't thinking much about myself , Mr. Costa .

229
00:21:28,294 --> 00:21:30,645
I just don 't see how something like that could happen .

230
00:21:30,903 --> 00:21:33,728
Come on now , Ben . We still got a camp to feed here now , don 't we ?

231
00:21:33,752 --> 00:21:34,896
Yes , sir .

232
00:21:35,145 --> 00:21:39,567
Besides , fifty bucks more a week can 't be all that bad , now , can it ?

233
00:21:39,903 --> 00:21:43,661
No , sir . I always thought he had a little devil in him .

234
00:21:45,356 --> 00:21:48,911
And fifteen dollars a week more for the rest of you , eh ?

235
00:21:49,825 --> 00:21:52,372
- That 's real generous of you , sir . - Well , now ...

236
00:21:53,567 --> 00:21:56,383
Ben , there is one thing , though ...

237
00:22:00,387 --> 00:22:04,072
There 's really no reason for the campers to find out what happened .

238
00:22:04,403 --> 00:22:05,591
You know what I mean ?

239
00:22:05,899 --> 00:22:07,489
Too , um ,

240
00:22:08,283 --> 00:22:10,098
gruesome , I think .

241
00:22:10,284 --> 00:22:12,333
So why don 't we just say that Artie

242
00:22:12,611 --> 00:22:15,762
found himself another job , should anybody happen to ask .

243
00:22:17,168 --> 00:22:19,408
Sure , sure . Whatever you say , sir .

244
00:22:19,583 --> 00:22:23,194
Good , and do me a favor . Tell your friends here to say the same thing .

245
00:22:23,387 --> 00:22:24,737
